{{!-- Everything permanent about this character, in the two kinds 2e has.

      Cairn files Scars under Growth — "with some notable exceptions (such as Scars), growth
      should always stem from a character's experiences in the game world" (Warden's Guide,
      Growth) — so this is one tab with a zone each. Scars are the table-driven kind, oldest
      first, which is the only order they have. Growth is the kind the Warden grants from what
      happened in play.

      Pending and taken are told apart by what the row OFFERS, not by a colour: a scar whose gain
      is still owed carries the die that takes it. The tag under the text is the record — "Max Hit
      Protection 4 → 7" — and it is printed, never editable: the number that rules is the
      character's own maximum, and it is edited in the edit window behind the quill. It sits under
      the sentence rather than beside it: beside, a three-line sentence left it floating mid-row
      with nothing to align to.

      A growth's second tag is its milestone progress, and it is absent when the growth was never
      a checklist — "0/0" would claim a list that does not exist.

      The Scars add takes a Scar with no hit behind it: a Warden handing one out, or a character
      being written up after the fact. --}}
<section class="tab {{tabs.growth.cssClass}}" data-group="primary" data-tab="growth">
    <div class="cairn-zone-head">
        <h4 class="cairn-zone">{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.Title'}}</h4>
        {{#if editable}}
        <a class="cairn-zone-add" data-action="scarCreate">
            <i class="fas fa-plus" inert></i><span>{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.Add'}}</span>
        </a>
        {{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="cairn-zone-rule" data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="zone-scars" data-ink-w="1" data-ink-a="0.34"></div>
    <ol class="cairn-plain-list cairn-record-list">
        {{#each scars as |s|}}
        <li class="cairn-record draggable" data-item-id="{{s.id}}"
            {{#unless @last}}data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="scar-{{s.id}}" data-ink-w="0.9" data-ink-a="0.42" data-ink-at="bottom"{{/unless}}>
            <span class="cairn-record-body">
                <span class="cairn-record-text"><strong>{{s.name}}</strong> {{{s.description}}}</span>
                {{#if s.outcome}}<span class="cairn-item-tag cairn-record-tag">{{s.outcome}}</span>{{/if}}
            </span>
            <span class="cairn-item-controls">
                {{#if @root.editable}}{{#if s.pending}}
                <a data-action="scarResolve" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.Resolve'}}"><i class="fas fa-dice-d6"></i></a>
                {{/if}}{{/if}}
                <a data-action="itemEdit" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.EditItem'}}"><i class="fas fa-pencil"></i></a>
                {{#if @root.editable}}
                <a data-action="itemDelete" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.DeleteItem'}}"><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i></a>
                {{/if}}
            </span>
        </li>
        {{else}}
        <li class="cairn-empty">{{localize 'CAIRN.Scar.None'}}</li>
        {{/each}}
    </ol>

    <div class="cairn-zone-head">
        <h4 class="cairn-zone">{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.Zone'}}</h4>
        {{#if editable}}
        <a class="cairn-zone-add" data-action="growthCreate">
            <i class="fas fa-plus" inert></i><span>{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.Add'}}</span>
        </a>
        {{/if}}
    </div>
    <div class="cairn-zone-rule" data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="zone-growth" data-ink-w="1" data-ink-a="0.34"></div>
    <ol class="cairn-plain-list cairn-record-list">
        {{#each growth as |g|}}
        <li class="cairn-record draggable" data-item-id="{{g.id}}"
            {{#unless @last}}data-ink="hline" data-ink-seed="growth-{{g.id}}" data-ink-w="0.9" data-ink-a="0.42" data-ink-at="bottom"{{/unless}}>
            <span class="cairn-record-body">
                <span class="cairn-record-text"><strong>{{g.name}}</strong> {{{g.description}}}</span>
                {{#if g.tags}}
                <span class="cairn-record-tags">
                    {{#if g.outcome}}<span class="cairn-item-tag cairn-record-tag">{{g.outcome}}</span>{{/if}}
                    {{#if g.progress}}<span class="cairn-item-tag cairn-record-tag">{{g.progress}}</span>{{/if}}
                </span>
                {{/if}}
            </span>
            <span class="cairn-item-controls">
                {{#if @root.editable}}{{#unless g.resolved}}
                <a data-action="growthApply" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.Apply'}}"><i class="fas fa-arrow-up"></i></a>
                {{/unless}}{{/if}}
                <a data-action="itemEdit" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.EditItem'}}"><i class="fas fa-pencil"></i></a>
                {{#if @root.editable}}
                <a data-action="itemDelete" data-tooltip="{{localize 'CAIRN.DeleteItem'}}"><i class="fas fa-xmark"></i></a>
                {{/if}}
            </span>
        </li>
        {{else}}
        <li class="cairn-empty">{{localize 'CAIRN.Growth.None'}}</li>
        {{/each}}
    </ol>
</section>
